@host = http://localhost:8080

### 1. 로그인 (토큰을 전역 변수 token 에 저장) - 이메일/비밀번호는 본인 계정으로 수정
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "Test1234!"
}

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.data.accessToken); %}

### 2. 엔진/망 모드 (4)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/engines
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. 업로드 (5) - 같은 폴더에 sample.pdf 를 두세요. extractImages=true 면 추출 이미지 1장이 생깁니다
POST {{host}}/api/v1/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./sample.pdf
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="engine"

AUTO
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="extractImages"

true
--boundary--

> {% client.global.set("documentId", response.body.data.documentId); client.global.set("runId", response.body.data.runId); %}

### 4. 목록 (6) - page 는 0부터, size 1~50, sort=createdAt,desc|asc, status 는 선택
GET {{host}}/api/v1/documents?page=0&size=10&sort=createdAt,desc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. 목록 - 상태 필터
GET {{host}}/api/v1/documents?status=DONE
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. 상세 (7) - 업로드 약 2초 뒤 status 가 DONE, latestRun.pages / images 가 채워집니다
GET {{host}}/api/v1/documents/{{documentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

> {% if (response.body.data.latestRun && response.body.data.latestRun.images.length > 0) { client.global.set("imageId", response.body.data.latestRun.images[0].imageId); } %}

### 7. 원본 PDF (9)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/documents/{{documentId}}/file
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. 실행 이력 (10)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/documents/{{documentId}}/runs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. 실행 상세 (11)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/documents/{{documentId}}/runs/{{runId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 10. 내보내기 txt (13)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/documents/{{documentId}}/runs/{{runId}}/export?format=txt
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 11. 내보내기 json (13)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/documents/{{documentId}}/runs/{{runId}}/export?format=json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 12. 추출 이미지 (14) - 상세 조회(6)를 먼저 실행해 imageId 를 저장해야 합니다
GET {{host}}/api/v1/documents/{{documentId}}/runs/{{runId}}/images/{{imageId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 13. 재처리 (12) - 새 run 이 추가되고 202
POST {{host}}/api/v1/documents/{{documentId}}/reprocess
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "engine": "TESSERACT",
  "extractImages": false
}

> {% client.global.set("runId", response.body.data.runId); %}

### 14. 삭제 (8)
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/documents/{{documentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### --- 실패 케이스 ---

### F1. 파일 없이 업로드 -> 400 INVALID_REQUEST
POST {{host}}/api/v1/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="engine"

AUTO
--boundary--

### F2. 폐쇄망에서 OPENAI -> 400 ENGINE_NOT_ALLOWED
POST {{host}}/api/v1/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./sample.pdf
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="engine"

OPENAI
--boundary--

### F3. 없는 문서 -> 404 DOCUMENT_NOT_FOUND
GET {{host}}/api/v1/documents/999999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### F4. 없는 run -> 404 RUN_NOT_FOUND
GET {{host}}/api/v1/documents/{{documentId}}/runs/999999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### F5. export format 오류 -> 400 INVALID_REQUEST
GET {{host}}/api/v1/documents/{{documentId}}/runs/{{runId}}/export?format=pdf
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### F6. size 범위 초과 -> 400 INVALID_REQUEST
GET {{host}}/api/v1/documents?size=100
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### F7. 토큰 없이 -> 401 UNAUTHORIZED
GET {{host}}/api/v1/documents
